# The screenshots in docs/: the first screen, a finished turn, the diff and
# journal panels, an approval card, the session tree and the palette, over
# the same small project and scripted model as the README's film.
size 100 32
model docs-tour.json
sh sh $REPO/scripts/kshot/scenarios/acme-web.sh $KHOME/code/acme-web
scrub \d\d:\d\d:\d\d => 09:41:07
scrub \b\d\d:\d\d\b => 09:41
scrub [0-9a-z]{4}…[0-9a-z]{4} => 0193…a7c2
scrub turn \d+(\.\d+)?s => turn 4.6s
scrub \b\d+ms\b => 12ms
scrub Working · \d+:\d\d => Working · 0:02
scrub [⠋⠙⠹⠸⠼⠴⠦⠧⠇⠏] => ⠏
start sh -c 'cd $KHOME/code/acme-web && exec node $REPO/bin/kubic.js tui'
waitfor PREFLIGHT
idle
snap first-screen
type make slugify handle accents, then run the tests
key Enter
waitfor review diff 20000
idle 600
snap session
key C-o
idle
snap diff-panel
key C-r
idle
snap journal-panel
key Escape
idle
type clear the build output
key Enter
waitfor APPROVAL 15000
idle 900
snap approval-card
key Escape
waitfor stays as it is 15000
idle 600
type what does slugify return for an empty title?
key Enter
waitfor returns '' 15000
idle 600
type /tree
key Enter
waitfor Session tree
idle
snap session-tree
key Escape
idle
key C-p
idle
snap palette
